          </a>
          <a href="/en/domestic-violence-divorce-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Domestic Violence and Divorce UAE</strong>
            <span>Protection orders and impact on custody</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/divorce-employer-visa-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Divorce and UAE Visa Status</strong>
            <span>What happens to residency after divorce</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/alimony-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Alimony in UAE</strong>
            <span>Maintenance amounts and enforcement</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/divorce-in-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>UAE Divorce Law Overview</strong>
            <span>How the system works for expats and nationals</span>
